{
  "bvid": "BV128411n7Mf",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "6951565b38c11ef2bc592b5e69527f636654699cee75e65712c1428231a447f3",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 4019,
      "end_ms": 7500,
      "text": "一要有一些道德底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 7940,
      "end_ms": 12380,
      "text": "虽然我们说道德是一个js比较低的一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 12380,
      "end_ms": 13920,
      "text": "法则学的环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 14280,
      "end_ms": 16360,
      "text": "我们不妨说一说道德"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 24700,
      "end_ms": 30450,
      "text": "自爆说显然是违法的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 30450,
      "end_ms": 33920,
      "text": "显然是反政府"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 33920,
      "end_ms": 35510,
      "text": "反建制的言论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 67360,
      "end_ms": 70039,
      "text": "你们的存在令我感到太失望了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 73060,
      "end_ms": 74940,
      "text": "这不是天真幼稚的问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 76140,
      "end_ms": 81140,
      "text": "我感受到的是纯粹的恶意和卑劣"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 85700,
      "end_ms": 87760,
      "text": "这是一个道德要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 87760,
      "end_ms": 88900,
      "text": "另外一个道德要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 88900,
      "end_ms": 89780,
      "text": "就是说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 104440,
      "end_ms": 107040,
      "text": "他有个反例就是激流网"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 108180,
      "end_ms": 109640,
      "text": "反例就是激流网"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 110600,
      "end_ms": 114920,
      "text": "他可以公开的讲一些啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 114920,
      "end_ms": 119420,
      "text": "这个什么中地论这种东西比它温和的都不能讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 119420,
      "end_ms": 120800,
      "text": "他可以公开的讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 120800,
      "end_ms": 122320,
      "text": "他可以钓鱼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 123900,
      "end_ms": 126200,
      "text": "可以组织学习班"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 126200,
      "end_ms": 127880,
      "text": "公开的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 129999,
      "end_ms": 133380,
      "text": "在首善之地组织读书班学习班"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 134459,
      "end_ms": 135799,
      "text": "这样钓鱼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 135799,
      "end_ms": 137320,
      "text": "这是个反例"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 138179,
      "end_ms": 141480,
      "text": "那么第二点就是这个你绝对不能做这种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 147999,
      "end_ms": 149820,
      "text": "叫影什么什么弹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 151779,
      "end_ms": 152819,
      "text": "叫什么呼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 152819,
      "end_ms": 153179,
      "text": "叫什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 153179,
      "end_ms": 154679,
      "text": "什么蛋吸引什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 154679,
      "end_ms": 158639,
      "text": "什么弹子弹的弹中间那个字是个姓氏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 160979,
      "end_ms": 163260,
      "text": "这是第三个绝对不能做的事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 167380,
      "end_ms": 168880,
      "text": "这三件事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 172160,
      "end_ms": 176249,
      "text": "肌肉网都做了这三件事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 176249,
      "end_ms": 178109,
      "text": "哪一个激励网没在做啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 178109,
      "end_ms": 179600,
      "text": "第一件事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 181380,
      "end_ms": 182540,
      "text": "他可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 182540,
      "end_ms": 185150,
      "text": "他不就怂恿别人去讲那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 185150,
      "end_ms": 188620,
      "text": "公开在台面上讲这种违法的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 188880,
      "end_ms": 189600,
      "text": "我不说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 189600,
      "end_ms": 191640,
      "text": "我依法不是非法的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 191640,
      "end_ms": 192840,
      "text": "在目前的法律制度下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 192840,
      "end_ms": 195320,
      "text": "非法的反建制的话语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 196920,
      "end_ms": 202369,
      "text": "有那么多讲座培训班去煽动一些没有社会经验"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 202369,
      "end_ms": 204919,
      "text": "没有阅历的学生去讲这东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 205939,
      "end_ms": 206800,
      "text": "第二点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 207220,
      "end_ms": 210250,
      "text": "他还统计收集这些学生的名单"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 210250,
      "end_ms": 211300,
      "text": "私人信息"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 212440,
      "end_ms": 213420,
      "text": "第三点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 215999,
      "end_ms": 217039,
      "text": "还起诉啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 217039,
      "end_ms": 219160,
      "text": "现在还我都没收到诉状呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 226679,
      "end_ms": 228720,
      "text": "这是三个道德底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 232880,
      "end_ms": 234700,
      "text": "你知乎上面再往左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 235960,
      "end_ms": 236620,
      "text": "你就低一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 236620,
      "end_ms": 237740,
      "text": "你就不满足"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 238779,
      "end_ms": 241180,
      "text": "而且你随时随地要做第三点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 243279,
      "end_ms": 245399,
      "text": "并且你客观的被动呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 245399,
      "end_ms": 248249,
      "text": "你不是把所有人都吸引到去做第二点了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 248249,
      "end_ms": 250199,
      "text": "把这些人名单不就统计起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 250199,
      "end_ms": 254380,
      "text": "给你点赞的那些人不是统计起来吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 254380,
      "end_ms": 256779,
      "text": "三点基本道德底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 259579,
      "end_ms": 262220,
      "text": "就是在公开互联网上这样做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 264920,
      "end_ms": 266980,
      "text": "你这他妈你都公开的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 266980,
      "end_ms": 268120,
      "text": "你你非要说一声"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 268120,
      "end_ms": 269340,
      "text": "你是召回派"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 271640,
      "end_ms": 273260,
      "text": "你在干什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 276759,
      "end_ms": 278339,
      "text": "这个是三个底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 279539,
      "end_ms": 281140,
      "text": "你如果要批评我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 281539,
      "end_ms": 282739,
      "text": "这三个底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 282739,
      "end_ms": 283219,
      "text": "你这么想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 283219,
      "end_ms": 285920,
      "text": "想清楚你要干什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 287040,
      "end_ms": 292159,
      "text": "所有别人去就是说就是说就是公开形象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 293419,
      "end_ms": 298500,
      "text": "公开的什么违法犯罪的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 298500,
      "end_ms": 300600,
      "text": "反政府反间之言论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 300600,
      "end_ms": 301800,
      "text": "你是不是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 301800,
      "end_ms": 303660,
      "text": "我说这个说知乎平台"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 308560,
      "end_ms": 309480,
      "text": "他进不到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 309480,
      "end_ms": 310680,
      "text": "他是这个资本"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 310680,
      "end_ms": 312140,
      "text": "他的投机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 312880,
      "end_ms": 313500,
      "text": "我不知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 313500,
      "end_ms": 314280,
      "text": "政治投机吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 314280,
      "end_ms": 314940,
      "text": "我不是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 314940,
      "end_ms": 316680,
      "text": "他是某种投机性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 316680,
      "end_ms": 318240,
      "text": "没什么话好说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 318240,
      "end_ms": 320000,
      "text": "但是你们这些小孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 323060,
      "end_ms": 323860,
      "text": "你好好想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 323860,
      "end_ms": 324940,
      "text": "你这种东西叫批评"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 324940,
      "end_ms": 326160,
      "text": "算批评吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 327199,
      "end_ms": 328479,
      "text": "你说的那些话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 328479,
      "end_ms": 331180,
      "text": "谁谁给这些话负责任"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 339819,
      "end_ms": 340960,
      "text": "道德"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 341300,
      "end_ms": 345110,
      "text": "当然说就说道德是一个比较传统的道德主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 345110,
      "end_ms": 346970,
      "text": "是一个比较传统的意识形态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 346970,
      "end_ms": 349040,
      "text": "我们这里讲的不是道德主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 349980,
      "end_ms": 354110,
      "text": "这叫基本的一个行动者的底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 354110,
      "end_ms": 355840,
      "text": "人格的底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 356840,
      "end_ms": 359620,
      "text": "你们嘴巴上唱那些高"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 359620,
      "end_ms": 362020,
      "text": "在飘在天空中的那些念那些经的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 362020,
      "end_ms": 364740,
      "text": "你有没有看到你有没有遵守这个底线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 365500,
      "end_ms": 369060,
      "text": "然后你说我我也在老"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 369060,
      "end_ms": 369900,
      "text": "我我强烈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 369900,
      "end_ms": 371420,
      "text": "我从来没有挂过人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 373660,
      "end_ms": 376080,
      "text": "说当年我和钱在狗子争论的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 376080,
      "end_ms": 377040,
      "text": "我人肉过他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 377040,
      "end_ms": 378380,
      "text": "我没有人肉过他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 379100,
      "end_ms": 380380,
      "text": "这个争论的点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 380380,
      "end_ms": 384820,
      "text": "就是说潜在狗子说我的一个qq群的群主"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 384820,
      "end_ms": 385840,
      "text": "能漏过他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 385840,
      "end_ms": 390400,
      "text": "我当时跟他就告一段事件啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 390400,
      "end_ms": 391660,
      "text": "事情告一段落"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 391660,
      "end_ms": 394400,
      "text": "那个视频里面我当时就直接就问他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 394700,
      "end_ms": 396080,
      "text": "你有没有实质性证据"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 396080,
      "end_ms": 397220,
      "text": "你有没有证据给出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 397220,
      "end_ms": 398440,
      "text": "他说他也没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 399199,
      "end_ms": 400869,
      "text": "他没有证据啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 400869,
      "end_ms": 402519,
      "text": "我直接当面质问呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 402519,
      "end_ms": 405099,
      "text": "你有没有证据说我的那个什么qq群的那个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 405099,
      "end_ms": 406200,
      "text": "去人肉你的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 406460,
      "end_ms": 407780,
      "text": "他也没有证据啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 409460,
      "end_ms": 411140,
      "text": "我也没有从来没有人漏过他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 411140,
      "end_ms": 412260,
      "text": "这是谣言"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 413879,
      "end_ms": 416779,
      "text": "其次佐伊23"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 420900,
      "end_ms": 423720,
      "text": "都是机滤网那一系的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 425000,
      "end_ms": 427120,
      "text": "你说我把左圈的人都打进了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 427120,
      "end_ms": 429460,
      "text": "那是因为他们占了这个网络"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 429460,
      "end_ms": 432380,
      "text": "左翼文化的这么一个好像弄"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 432380,
      "end_ms": 434660,
      "text": "而且弄得好像好多个分身的呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 434660,
      "end_ms": 436760,
      "text": "隐瞒他们之间相互的关联的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 436760,
      "end_ms": 439220,
      "text": "这关联不是我揭露出来的吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 442920,
      "end_ms": 445100,
      "text": "我没有打其他的左翼吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 445560,
      "end_ms": 447360,
      "text": "其他的我没有去打他吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 447360,
      "end_ms": 449340,
      "text": "红通我说过他哪里不对了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 449340,
      "end_ms": 450240,
      "text": "屁股歪了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 450240,
      "end_ms": 451800,
      "text": "他没做那事儿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 453600,
      "end_ms": 455150,
      "text": "其他的我没骂过吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 455150,
      "end_ms": 458240,
      "text": "而且其他人家也不不作为一个王者存在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 458599,
      "end_ms": 460740,
